docs {
  `POST /v1/tenants/quarantine/rows/:table/:id/rehome`

  Moves a quarantined row (and its children and files) to a real tenant. Platform admin with quarantine maintenance access only.

  - **Auth:** Bearer access token (`{{accessToken}}`, set by `auth/Login`)
  - **Listeners:** internal
  - **Success:** `204`
}
